            "notes": "## Power\n\nIn Round 3, you should get either [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49) or [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) depending on which power you picked in Round 1. [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49) will essentially make your Whipshot a guaranteed hit, which will greatly help with farming your ultimate in combination with [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4). [God Ray](item_4abb5cdb-f113-4f21-aa0a-e67d95a11fd0) should only be used in combination with [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49) if you're playing against [Pharah](hero_0baf7420-ff13-4b92-81f7-ca21b61dacf9) or any other oppressive flyer.\n\n## Items\n\nYou should be able to afford [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) and [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) now. If you're struggling against flyers, go for [Chain Extender](item_0a0d50dc-0ec9-42f6-a0ad-c373eb44dc6d). Otherwise, fill the rest of your slots with cheap items that give [Ability Power](stat_ability_power).",
