            "notes": "## Power\n\nIn Round 7, you should go for [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee) or [Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3) if you went for [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0) in Round 5, but I find [Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3) to be a little underwhelming. Otherwise, you can also go for [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422), [God Ray](item_4abb5cdb-f113-4f21-aa0a-e67d95a11fd0) or [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8).\n\n## Items\n\nAs for the last item, you can get [Dragon's Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634) if you want to, but [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) and [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) are also great options. [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) is very expensive though, so do keep that in mind if you're a bit lower on Stadium Cash. Go for [Chain Extender](item_0a0d50dc-0ec9-42f6-a0ad-c373eb44dc6d) if you picked [God Ray](item_4abb5cdb-f113-4f21-aa0a-e67d95a11fd0) as your power. If you can't afford any of these, get [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) or any other cheaper item that gives [Ability Power](stat_ability_power).",
